# .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# List of commits to ignore when computing `git blame`.
# Used to exclude repository-wide reformatting and automated styling commits
# so that the historical authorship of lines is preserved.
#
# To configure git locally to use this file automatically:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# Syntax: Full 40-character commit hash followed by a comment describing the commit.

# Placeholder example:
# 6d4b29c1e7a4f9103c8342125bb79339e31998e1 # style: apply ruff format repository-wide
